## Ignore TwinCAT HMI temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular TwinCAT HMI add-ons.

.engineering_servers/
tchmipublish.journal.json
liveview_*
*.cache
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.pid
**/.hmiframework/
**/.hmipkgs/
**/*.d.ts
**/*.js.map

## BUILD RESULTS (F-12). The header above has promised these since the file was
## written and listed none of them, so `build.log` - 54 kB of MSBuild output -
## travelled into the delivered source archive. `.gitignore` already excluded it
## (`*.log`, line 84) and the nuspec never shipped it; the archive is assembled
## from the working directory, which honoured neither.
*.log
bin/
obj/
